# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/next-2 window (tp4/octo-2 + tp4/prod-fixes; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway
# commit of tp4/next-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from
# this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-next2-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image carries
# needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# B0 (STOP): the window image, built from the pushed tp4/next-2 head with the SHIP profile baked as the image's serving default (ENV QWEN_C2_PROFILE) and THATCH_SERVING_SESSION_CAP baked as its max-num-seqs (8):
# the SAME default production runs (c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic), so the image could serve. It carries the W2 kill switch (w2_switch.py), the region-read extension (qwen_kv_read, provenance
# check (g)) and levern_route's QWEN_FAST_LEVERN_KV_READ (tp4/prod-fixes), the prompt-lookup drafter (docs/tp4-lookup.md) and the octo-T8 / octo-2 modules (tp4/octo-2); every lever is off unless a job's profile turns it on.
# REFUSED by c2_serving_job.read_bake while the profile's owner_traffic_waiver decision is not APPROVED. READ: 'baking the serving default c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic with a session
# cap of 8', the provenance report with no problem line, the image id.
# A build, not a card job: it may run while the cards serve, never during a timing job. Duration (estimate): 40 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic
